  "5": {
   "segId": "Shabbat.105b.6",
   "sugya": "shabbat_105b_korea_al_meito",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "support",
     "object": "s_lemah_dome",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "הא למה זה דומה -- לספר תורה שנשרף",
     "supports": "p_omed_bishat_yetziat_neshama",
     "status": "live"
    },
    {
     "type": "objection",
     "object": "obj_ihu_omed",
     "kind": "tanya",
     "gloss_en": "ואי דקאי בשעת יציאת נשמה -- חיובי מיחייב, דתניא: רבי שמעון בן אלעזר אומר...",
     "against": "p_ok_mishna_lav_bnei_aveilut",
     "state": "answered"
    },
    {
     "type": "objection_answer",
     "object": "ans_dela_kaei",
     "gloss_en": "לא צריכא, דלא קאי בשעת יציאת נשמה -- needed only where he was not standing there when the soul departed",
     "answers": "obj_ihu_omed",
     "restores": "p_ok_mishna_lav_bnei_aveilut"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_omed_bishat_yetziat_neshama",
     "gloss_en": "R' Shimon b. Elazar: one standing by the dead at the time the soul departs is obliged to tear"
    }
   ]
  },
  "7": {
   "segId": "Shabbat.105b.8",
   "sugya": "shabbat_105b_korea_al_meito",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "support",
     "object": "s_nachat_ruach",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "דקעביד נחת רוח ליצרו -- he satisfies his inclination, so the tearing repairs",
     "supports": "p_avin_metaken",
     "status": "live"
    },
    {
     "type": "support",
     "object": "s_umanut_yetzer_hara",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "שכך אומנותו של יצר הרע... עד שאומר לו עבוד עבודה זרה",
     "supports": "p_ke_oved_az_korea",
     "status": "live"
    },
    {
     "type": "support",
     "object": "s_mai_kraa_el_zar",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "אמר רבי אבין: מאי קראה -- לא יהיה בך אל זר: the strange god within a man is the evil inclination",
     "supports": "p_ke_oved_az_korea",
     "status": "live"
    },
    {
     "type": "objection",
     "object": "obj_bimkalkel_mi_shamat",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "אימר דשמעת ליה לרבי יהודה במתקן, במקלקל מי שמעת ליה? -- you heard R' Yehuda [make liable] one who repairs; one who destroys?",
     "against": "p_baraita_kerabbi_yehuda",
     "state": "answered"
    },
    {
     "type": "objection_answer",
     "object": "ans_avin_nami_metaken",
     "gloss_en": "אמר רבי אבין: האי נמי מתקן הוא, דקעביד נחת רוח ליצרו (= p_avin_metaken)",
     "answers": "obj_bimkalkel_mi_shamat",
     "restores": "p_baraita_kerabbi_yehuda"
    },
    {
     "type": "objection",
     "object": "obj_mi_shrei",
     "kind": "tanya",
     "gloss_en": "וכהאי גוונא מי שרי? והתניא: המקרע בגדיו בחמתו... יהא בעיניך כעובד עבודה זרה -- may one tear thus at all, to satisfy the inclination?",
     "against": "p_avin_metaken",
     "state": "answered"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_avin_metaken",
     "gloss_en": "R' Avin: this one too is repairing"
    }
   ]
  },
  "8": {
