     "type": "objection_answer",
     "object": "ans_met_didei_met_dealma",
     "gloss_en": "לא קשיא: הא במת דידיה, הא במת דעלמא -- revised at 105b.4 to: his own dead not subject to mourning (= p_ok_mishna_lav_bnei_aveilut)",
