     "object": "obj_ihu_adam_kasher",
     "kind": "tanya",
     "gloss_en": "ואי אדם כשר הוא -- חיובי מיחייב, דתניא: ... כל הבוכה על אדם כשר מוחלין לו על כל עונותיו",
     "against": "p_ok_mishna_lav_bnei_aveilut",
     "state": "answered"
    },
    {
     "type": "objection_answer",
     "object": "ans_delav_adam_kasher",
     "gloss_en": "לא צריכא, דלאו אדם כשר הוא -- needed only where he is not an upright man",
     "answers": "obj_ihu_adam_kasher",
     "restores": "p_ok_mishna_lav_bnei_aveilut"
    },
    {
     "type": "objection",
     "object": "obj_ervona",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "כדי שיבכה?! ערבונא שקלי מיניה?! -- so that he weep? do they take a pledge from him? (replaced by אלא: מפני שלא בכה)",
     "against": "p_b_kedei_sheyivke",
     "state": "live"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_b_kedei_sheyivke",
     "gloss_en": "the baraita as cited: why do a man's sons and daughters die when young? so that he weep and mourn for an upright man"
    }
   ]
  },
